<title>NETHERLANDS: FORECAST - DUTCH COMPANY RESULTS WEEK OF APRIL 14-18.</title>
<headline>FORECAST - DUTCH COMPANY RESULTS WEEK OF APRIL 14-18.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-04-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Analysts' estimates of Dutch</p>
<p>company results for the week of April 14-18:</p>
<p>DATE--COMPANY-----PERIOD-----PROFIT----CONSENSUS---RANGE-----PVS</p>
<p>15/4  Vendex	YR 96/97  net profit   539.7     527/560   415</p>
<p>15/4  Vendex	Yr 96/97  op profit    373.3     361/384   286</p>
<p>15/4  Oce	   Q1	  net profit    46.0    40.1/50.9 27.4</p>
<p>NOTES - Profit figures exclude extraordinary items and are</p>
<p>in millions of guilders unless otherwise stated. They are stated</p>
<p>before deduction of preference dividends where applicable.</p>
<p>* Vendex operating profit estimate excludes real estate and</p>
<p>net profit figure includes &quot;value changes&quot;.</p>
<p>REUTER INSTRUMENT CODES (RICs) for other companies mentioned</p>
<p>in the table: Vendex , Oce .</p>
<p>FORECASTS CONTRIBUTED BY: Bangert Pontier, Delta Lloyd Bank,</p>
<p>Generale Bank, ING, Kempen &amp; Co, Labouchere, MeesPierson,</p>
<p>Rabo/IRIS, SNS Securities, Wesselius.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
